msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san? It's me, Shibayama, the guy who asked you to\r\n"
"help collect that loan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "Oh, hey. What's going on?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"I got a call from somebody claiming he saw Motoyama.\r\n"
"Says he's at the bowling alley."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"Sorry for the trouble, but would you mind going there and\r\n"
"looking for him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "The bowling alley? Got it."
msgstr "Al bowling? Ricevuto."

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"Yeah, thanks. I'll give you ten percent as a reward if you\r\n"
"can collect that loan."
msgstr ""

